{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
The document portal requires fusefs and user mounts:
  sysrc kld_list+=fusefs
  kldload fusefs
  sysctl vfs.usermount=1
Persist vfs.usermount=1 in /etc/sysctl.conf.

It also requires fdescfs with descriptor symlinks. Add to /etc/fstab:
  fdescfs /dev/fd fdescfs rw,rdlnk 0 0
Then mount /dev/fd if it is not already mounted. If it is already mounted,
check its options before changing it. Restart the desktop session after
installing the updated portal.
EOM
}
